aurora_meter.credits.migrate_lots will not cut a wallet over yet.

AuroraMeter.Credits.reverse/4 does not take the lot path yet, so a paid refund on a cut-over wallet would consume promotional lots in spend order and write nothing into `reversed`. Shadow runs and reports are unaffected.

Nothing was read and nothing was written. Run it without --no-shadow to
take the whole replay and reconciliation now; the cutover is a separate
decision and it needs the lot-aware refund path first (X250).

